# Copy this file to .env and fill in the value, then restart `npm run dev`
# (or rebuild) for it to take effect.
#
# The player-info form (src/pages/NameEntryPage.jsx) has nowhere to send its
# data — this app is a static site with no backend — so it posts straight to
# a Formspree endpoint instead. Without this set, the form still works, it
# just doesn't send anywhere.
#
# Setup (~2 minutes):
#   1. Go to https://formspree.io and sign up (free tier is enough).
#   2. Create a new form, set the notification email to the address where
#      you want submissions delivered.
#   3. Copy the endpoint shown (looks like https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx)
#      and paste it below.
#   4. Formspree will send a confirmation email to that address the first
#      time a submission comes in — you must click it once to activate.
VITE_PLAYER_INFO_ENDPOINT=
